[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 362.23, "timestamp": "00:06:02", "text": "ゲーム。ネコ・ジョクを見てください。こんにちは。楽しむ。私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 363.629, "timestamp": "00:06:03", "text": "行くよ。おやすみ。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 366.105, "timestamp": "00:06:06", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "\"joq will not actually sleep and will either- 1. watch yt and listen music. 2. read manhwa/watch anime"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 367.59, "timestamp": "00:06:07", "text": "ローは一人でいる。私は座っている悪魔です"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 369.83, "timestamp": "00:06:09", "text": "私の後ろにいて、ご存知のように私を導いてくれる"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 373.27, "timestamp": "00:06:13", "text": "何をすべきかとか、そういうことは、彼ができるからわかるんだよ"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 374.932, "timestamp": "00:06:14", "author": "@Ninja477", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/DgHpXlaDuDSPk2w40fljKZE0ZpWffCKDHKYfP2DNO6YWP5QEr5mBRcLrJDjF8KH0euY0GnYAF6c=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "fr"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 375.749, "timestamp": "00:06:15", "text": "私を自由に放っておいてくれ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 380.309, "timestamp": "00:06:20", "text": "そんな風に私のことを解釈するのはやめて。ああ、そうだね"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 382.189, "timestamp": "00:06:22", "text": "そして、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 385.43, "timestamp": "00:06:25", "text": "ストリームに少し変更を加えただけです"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 385.689, "timestamp": "00:06:25", "author": "@Ninja477", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/DgHpXlaDuDSPk2w40fljKZE0ZpWffCKDHKYfP2DNO6YWP5QEr5mBRcLrJDjF8KH0euY0GnYAF6c=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "then wake up tired tomorrow"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 388.469, "timestamp": "00:06:28", "text": "かぶせる。日付が決まったので、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 390.27, "timestamp": "00:06:30", "text": "日付は動的です"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 391.926, "timestamp": "00:06:31", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "or 3. hangout with friends on discord chat with em"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 394.07, "timestamp": "00:06:34", "text": "実は。だからシーンを切り替えるたびに、"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 394.785, "timestamp": "00:06:34", "author": "@Ninja477", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/DgHpXlaDuDSPk2w40fljKZE0ZpWffCKDHKYfP2DNO6YWP5QEr5mBRcLrJDjF8KH0euY0GnYAF6c=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "and do all this all over again"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 396.23, "timestamp": "00:06:36", "text": "ええと、自動的に調整されます"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 398.30899999999997, "timestamp": "00:06:38", "text": "などなど。私は実験をしてきました"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 401.59000000000003, "timestamp": "00:06:41", "text": "最近ストリーマーボードがあって、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 404.469, "timestamp": "00:06:44", "text": "それを使えば、たくさんの素晴らしいことができる。私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 407.15, "timestamp": "00:06:47", "text": "すごく驚いた"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 410.718, "timestamp": "00:06:50", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "mhm"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 412.629, "timestamp": "00:06:52", "text": "きちんときちんと探求されたことは一度もない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 415.51, "timestamp": "00:06:55", "text": "きちんと。これはすべて、いや、あなたはそう思う"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 417.909, "timestamp": "00:06:57", "text": "私には友達がいる。つまり、私には友達がいるんです"}]